{"session_id": "acceptance42-q23-ca19ea21-3f06-43f5-b5d6-290e31e4c456", "turns": [{"turn_id": "f1971aa063ef482c9cf089939313b6fc", "created_at": "2026-08-26T04:49:29.845623+00:00", "question": "【42题验收Q23】请说明VIL图片为什么不能单独证明某条道路一定积水或车辆能够安全通过，并通过证据链图指出还需要地面降雨量、排水能力、地形、积水深度、道路传感器和实时交通报告等数据。", "answer": "VIL 图像仅反映云体垂直积分液态水含量，不能单独证明道路积水或车辆可安全通行。本次事件 R19062708588472 的 VIL 峰值达 254、均值约 44.6、高值区占比约 39%，但 VIL 高并不等价于地表积水：它无法区分降水是否到达地面、路面排水是否及时、低洼地形是否汇水，也无法给出积水深度与交通实况。\n\n证据链所需补充数据：\n- 地面降雨量：验证 VIL 对应降水是否落地及强度；\n- 排水能力：管网/泵站容量决定积水能否快速消退；\n- 地形高程：识别易涝点与汇流路径；\n- 积水深度传感器：直接量化通行风险阈值；\n- 道路水位/流量传感器：提供路段级实时状态；\n- 实时交通报告：反映实际通行受阻与绕行情况。\n\n只有将 VIL 与上述多源数据融合，才能形成“气象→水文→路况”的完整证据链，支撑积水判定与安全通行决策。参考图：/api/artifacts/ae9c9aaf9a5f45dea2109f3550e66a62.png", "selected_tools": ["ds", "sevir", "geolocator", "cascast", "aurora"], "termination_reason": "agent_completed", "code_execution_count": 1, "evidence_execution_count": 1, "evidence_tool_call_count": 1, "postprocessing_success_count": 1, "tool_cost_summary": {"budget_units": 30.0, "used_units": 3.0, "remaining_units": 27.0, "exhausted": false}, "artifacts": [{"artifact_id": "e9d15b08bfaf4e6eb68f64c590ce316a", "url": "/api/artifacts/e9d15b08bfaf4e6eb68f64c590ce316a.png", "image_url": "/api/artifacts/e9d15b08bfaf4e6eb68f64c590ce316a.png", "title": "vil_limitation", "description": "由本轮执行代码生成。", "chart_type": "agent_generated", "status": "completed"}, {"artifact_id": "ae9c9aaf9a5f45dea2109f3550e66a62", "url": "/api/artifacts/ae9c9aaf9a5f45dea2109f3550e66a62.png", "image_url": "/api/artifacts/ae9c9aaf9a5f45dea2109f3550e66a62.png", "title": "Agent生成图", "description": "由本轮生成代码基于真实数据绘制。", "chart_type": "agent_generated", "status": "completed"}], "observations": [{"status": "error", "result": null, "stdout": "Could not save font_manager cache [Errno 13] Permission denied: 'C:\\\\Users\\\\zhaor\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\sevir-session-i3kc9s97\\\\fontlist-v390.json.matplotlib-lock'\n", "available_names": ["ax", "cube", "fig", "high_vil_frac", "mean_vil"